  "releaseNotes": "The Symphony Core Connector.\n\nSymphony Core is a high-performance enterprise platform that unifies business data, workflows, and integrations in one reliable backend foundation.\n\nSymphony Core is the backend platform of Symphony. It provides the server-side foundation with its own TCP/IP protocol, object and workflow handling, and user and role management.\n\nThis package is the base .NET Standard connector API. Use it in every Symphony Core application that must connect to the Symphony Core Server and work with backend data.\n\nAdd Connector.Extensions if you want helper and convenience APIs on top of the base connector. Add Connector.WinForms.Extensions if you build a Windows Forms client and need ready-made UI controls for displaying query, preload, and workflow structures.",
